{"version":1,"content":"<p>大埔宏福苑業主簽署出售其宏福苑單位《買賣協議》的限期昨日（15日）屆滿，房屋局發言人今日（16日）表示，A至H八座共1850戶業主已簽署《買賣協議》，佔八座單位總數93.2%。</p><p>政府表示，會繼續全速跟進契約轉讓手續以完成業權轉讓。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T07:41:39.808948+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T07:05:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T04:37:36.169834+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:37:48.618539+00:00","content_hash":"0e3bf7c7e4e0fe9a60bb187bf74bdc3188b15b0c66074d156b9121eb629b0e75","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}